{
  "id": "latin-america-international-championships",
  "name": "Latin America International Championships",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The Latin America International Championships are one of the International Championships that Play! Pokémon has held since the 2017 season, alongside North America, Europe and Oceania. Each International Championships promo came as a plain copy for every competitor, a Staff copy, and Top 8 and Champion copies for the players who reached the top eight of each division and for each division's winner.\n\nThe first, at the WTC Events Center in São Paulo on 21-23 April 2017, gave out Evolutions' Double Colorless Energy. Later years brought Sun & Moon's Ultra Ball, Brilliant Stars' Ultra Ball, Scarlet & Violet's Nest Ball and Temporal Forces' Buddy-Buddy Poffin, the same cards as the other International Championships.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Elite Fourum: Championship stamped Double Colorless Energy",
        "url": "https://www.elitefourum.com/t/championship-stamped-double-colorless-energy/20835"
      },
